  "details": "I've personally seen avatars on Quest that can do PLENTY. There is no real reason for the quest limit to be this low (10mb), especially with what many talented Avatar Creators can do FOR Quest instead of just PC (Without lagging them, even!). \n\nPersonally, this is affecting a friend group of mine that creates Avatars for the community. It is demotivating them HEAVILY. They don't want to make anything anymore because of such a low limit. I'd say, for the sake of more Avatar Creators who may be experiencing this same motivation issue, please reconsider this 10mb limit. Increase it, or return it to what it was before hand.",
